   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 418.65,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "选中候选在测试段的误差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 421.89,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "减去真值冠军的误差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 424.77,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "差多少，就是为这次选择付的钱。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 428.59,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "命中率是硬的，后悔值是软的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 432.31,
   "dur": 2.53,
   "speech": "这一集两个都报。"
  },
