   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 47,
   "start": 460.22,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "另留三十只完全没见过的股票。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 48,
   "start": 463.84,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "按代码排序，每十只取一只。"
  },
  {
